# A helper writes the path its caller hands: under `publish`, `stage` writes the metadata into the folder `publish`
# makes (`{publish.tmp}/meta.json`), not the JSON file `json.dump` writes as read alone (`*.json`, mathematics.md rule 5). The card
# `card` loads is the file `publish` opens and hands it, the one the variable `CARD` names, `{$CARD}` (`CARD` is the
# variable's name, no part of the path): the term names it, so the format `json.load` reads is no place of its own
# (mathematics.md, "Paths as terms"). It is read from the world: no step of `publish` wrote it, and it is no read back
# (rule 4), whether `publish` is closed, open or cut.

route publish.run
step run/publish
step run/publish/TemporaryDirectory
step run/publish/stage
step run/publish/stage/open
step run/publish/open
step run/publish/card

line entry > run call
line run/publish/TemporaryDirectory > TemporaryDirectory·tmp@run/publish/TemporaryDirectory value
line TemporaryDirectory·tmp@run/publish/TemporaryDirectory > run/publish value             # `Path(tmp)`
line TemporaryDirectory·tmp@run/publish/TemporaryDirectory > run/publish/stage/open value   # `dest / "meta.json"`
line run/publish/stage/open > TextIOWrapper·f@run/publish/stage/open value
line TextIOWrapper·f@run/publish/stage/open > run/publish/stage value                      # `json.dump(.., f)`
line run/publish/stage > File({publish.tmp}/meta.json) own
line Disk({$CARD}) > run/publish own                                                      # `open(os.environ["CARD"])`
line run/publish/open > TextIOWrapper·f@run/publish/open value
line TextIOWrapper·f@run/publish/open > run/publish value
line TextIOWrapper·f@run/publish/open > run/publish/card value
line Disk({$CARD}) > run/publish/card own                                                 # read from the world, through `f`
line run/publish/card > run/publish back
line run/publish > run back
line run > Screen own

home TemporaryDirectory·tmp@run/publish/TemporaryDirectory run/publish
home TextIOWrapper·f@run/publish/stage/open run/publish/stage
home TextIOWrapper·f@run/publish/open run/publish

side entry left
side Disk({$CARD}) left
side File({publish.tmp}/meta.json) right
side Screen right
